welcome all to suffolk's first low  energy showcase  we are extremely excited to bring  together businesses and community  organizations from across the region  sharing one major thing in common the  aim to become carbon neutral  baber and mid-suffolk district councils  have recognized the existence and  reality of the climate emergency and we  have committed to the suffolk wide aim  to become carbon neutral by 2030.  in november the world's attention will  turn to glasgow and cop26 the u.n  climate summit where nations will come  together to discuss what steps we need  to take globally to address the issue of  climate change  this highlights not only the importance  of climate change as a problem but the  significance of doing our part for a  greener society now  and so on a local level we are delighted  to be able to celebrate sustainability  and green energy  in such a way that brings the councils  and communities together  this is the perfect opportunity to  demonstrate our commitment in tackling  climate change  where we can all build build on our  knowledge of green energy and prepare  for a new way of living that enhances an  eco-friendly ethos  thank you everyone i'll now hand over to  councillor morley  thank you council award  suffolk is a hub of great ideas for  clean energy offering real solutions  that can genuinely make a positive  impact towards carbon reduction and will  benefit us both locally and nationally  from solar energy to ground source heat  pumps local energy is already a growing  sector  there is a huge potential to increase  more skilled jobs in the region whilst  also supporting our joint ambition in  developing a cleaner and greener space  to live work and visit  green energy has many benefits  the least of which are offering our  communities a cleaner brighter and more  sustainable future  together we can help businesses and  community groups reduce the impact on  the environment  lower energy costs and contribute to the  fight against climate change  that's what we are here for  and we are pleased to be working with  such forward thinking  partners for this showcase  we hope you enjoy the workshops  throughout the day  learn new things from our expert  speakers and come away from this event  with a positive and practical outlook  on how you can contribute to a  sustainable and carbon neutral future  thank you
 

